    "TG7 [in text, 7.2 at fc80d72] Worst finite e = max over the finite e_m of BOTH P and X; if neither has one, every d_m is 0.",
    "TG8 [in text, 7.2 at fc80d72] Bootstrap: numpy default_rng(20261013), resampling materials, percentile interval of HL. Secondary; the draw order (95 % then 90 %, H1a..e then H2) is not in the text, so values need not match analyse.py bit for bit.",
